      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "BVLGARI's Summer 2026 collection has just hit stores, and the Divas' Dream evening bags, Serpenti Forever top-handle bags, and Serpenti Cuore heart-shaped bags are all decked out in a dazzling new 'armor'—whether it's crystal-encrusted fan motifs, a scattering of vibrant colored glass gems, or raised gold bead patterns, each piece shimmers like jewelry.",
