      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Divas' Dream Gem Evening Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The most opulent piece this season, this Divas' Dream evening bag takes its cue from mosaic patterns. The cover is crafted from gold-plated brass with an openwork design that lends an airy, ethereal feel. The showstopper is the 216 unique cabochon-cut colored glass gems hand-set by artisans, creating a kaleidoscopic effect that underscores the house's craftsmanship and color mastery.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
