      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This series is inspired by the mosaic floor patterns of Rome's Baths of Caracalla (Terme di Caracalla), using densely set two-tone crystals to recreate the iconic 'fan' tiling pattern.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Serpenti Forever Day-to-night bag still features the seductive serpent-head clasp, but the highlight is its body, which is covered in crystals of two different hues to form an elegant fan motif. You can choose from topaz, olive green, or amethyst—each with a crystalline sparkle that feels both luxurious and refined.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
